# View Probes and Other Plugins #

## About Plugins #

NVIDIA NeMo Auditor uses Garak for audit functionality and Garak uses plugins .
Plugins provide functionality such as the probes and detectors that do the actual examination of the target, the generators that interface with models, and even the harnesses that manage run orchestration.

## Viewing All Plugins #

```
importosfromnemo_platformimportNeMoPlatformclient=NeMoPlatform(base_url=os.environ.get("NMP_BASE_URL","http://localhost:8080"),workspace="default",)plugins=client.audit.plugins.list(page_size=300)print(plugins.model_dump_json(indent=2))
```

```
nmpauditpluginslist--page-size300-fjson
```

